About TRON
----------

TRON is a 2 players game. Move around the sreen, eating dots. But
watch out! if you hit something else than a dot, your opponent win the
round!

Installation
------------

- Copy the file Tron.opa to your \APP\ directory 
- Copy the file Tron.pic to your \OPD\ directory
- If you want to use the sound option, 
  copy the files explode.wve and zou.wve to your \WVE\ directory.

Use psion-I to install TRON as usual.

TRON will also create a file tron.def in the \OPD\ directory of the
internal disk.

